TI  - Can AI Scientist Agents Learn from Lab-in-the-Loop Feedback? Evidence from Iterative Perturbation Discovery
AU  - Wainrib, Gilles
AU  - Bodinier, Barbara
AU  - Dakhli, Haitem
AU  - Monserrat, Josep
AU  - Perez, Almudena Espin
