TI  - Beyond the 80/20 Rule: High-Entropy Minority Tokens Drive Effective Reinforcement Learning for LLM Reasoning
AU  - Wang, Shenzhi
AU  - Yu, Le
AU  - Gao, Chang
AU  - Zheng, Chujie
AU  - Liu, Shixuan
AU  - Lu, Rui
