TI  - A Mechanistic Understanding of Alignment Algorithms: A Case Study on DPO and Toxicity
AU  - Lee, Andrew
AU  - Bai, Xiaoyan
AU  - Pres, Itamar
AU  - Wattenberg, Martin
AU  - Kummerfeld, Jonathan K.
